{"text":"We teach girls that they cannot be sexual beings in the way that boys are. If we have sons, we don't mind knowing about our son's girlfriends, but our daughter's boyfriends God forbid. But of course when the time is right, we expect those girls to bring back the perfect man to be their husband. We police girls, we praise girls for virginity, but we don't praise boys for virginity. And it's always made me wonder how exactly this is supposed to work out because the loss of virginity is usually a process that involves people. Recently a young woman was gun-graped in a university in Nigeria. I think some of us know about that. And the response of many young Nigerians, both male and female, was something along the lines of this. Yes, rape is wrong. But what is a girl doing in a room with four boys? Now if we can forget the horrible inhumanity of that response, these Nigerians have been raised to think of women as inherently guilty.","words":[{"text":"We","start":0.54,"end":1.0},{"text":"teach","start":1.0,"end":1.24},{"text":"girls","start":1.24,"end":1.58},{"text":"that","start":1.58,"end":1.74},{"text":"they","start":1.74,"end":1.88},{"text":"cannot","start":1.88,"end":2.22},{"text":"be","start":2.22,"end":2.5},{"text":"sexual","start":2.5,"end":2.92},{"text":"beings","start":2.92,"end":3.46},{"text":"in","start":3.46,"end":3.94},{"text":"the","start":3.94,"end":4.04},{"text":"way","start":4.04,"end":4.22},{"text":"that","start":4.22,"end":4.38},{"text":"boys","start":4.38,"end":4.64},{"text":"are","start":4.64,"end":5.06,"punct":"."},{"text":"If","start":5.32,"end":5.5},{"text":"we","start":5.5,"end":5.64},{"text":"have","start":5.64,"end":5.78},{"text":"sons","start":5.78,"end":6.16,"punct":","},{"text":"we","start":6.5,"end":6.56},{"text":"don't","start":6.56,"end":6.68},{"text":"mind","start":6.68,"end":6.88},{"text":"knowing","start":6.88,"end":7.1},{"text":"about","start":7.1,"end":7.38},{"text":"our","start":7.38,"end":7.6},{"text":"son's","start":7.6,"